r: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-size:16px"><strong class="cjk"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正黑体_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-weight: normal">三、相关事项要注意</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p style="text-align:left;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.99cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal">1.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>准备工作要做好。</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">请按时打印准考证，仔细查看</span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>考点名称</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">和</span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>考点地址</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-weight: normal">，</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">认真阅读准考证上的相关要求并严格执行，按照准考证上规定的时间和地点参加考试。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.99cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal">2.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>入场出场有时限。</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">考试开始前</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal">30</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">分钟，考生凭</span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>准考证</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">和</span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>身份证</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">进入考场；考试开始</span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal">30</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">分钟后，迟到考生不得入场；考试期间，考生不得提前交卷、退场。</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 0.99cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-before: auto; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family:Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal">3.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>个人物品要放妥。</strong></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px">考生</span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>严禁将手机、计算器、</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>智能眼镜、</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>智能手表、智能手环、蓝牙耳机等各种电子、通信、计算、存储或其</strong></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#000000"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GBK"><spa